<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

134
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's become just the two of us...</font>

135
00:10:08,830 --> 00:10:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we're a three-man squad, right?</font>

136
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:15,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

137
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:19,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys...</font>

138
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage?</font>

139
00:10:25,770 --> 00:10:29,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This person... is Jiraiya,
one of the legendary Sannin?</font>

140
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you without permission,</font>

141
00:10:32,770 --> 00:10:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">go out past the border of
the Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

142
00:10:35,610 --> 00:10:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you know at least that you'll be sent
to prison as Rogue Ninja, right?</font>

143
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:42,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use stopping us!</font>

144
00:10:44,290 --> 00:10:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't stop you.</font>

145
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:51,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been given a mission
by Hokage-sama.</font>

146
00:10:52,330 --> 00:10:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're to investigate and report
on the Land of Rice Paddies</font>

147
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:59,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where the Village Hidden in Sound is
and where Sasuke has been taken away.</font>

148
00:11:00,470 --> 00:11:03,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission is set to be carried out
in a group of three.</font>

149
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of now you will work under me.
You got a problem?!</font>

150
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they're the biggest of fools.</font>

151
00:11:27,290 --> 00:11:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They won't stop even if you tried.</font>

152
00:11:29,910 --> 00:11:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate
we'll lose two important subordinates!</font>

153
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:38,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll recognize it as a special mission</font>

154
00:11:38,300 --> 00:11:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the goal of investigating
the Village Hidden in Sound, right?</font>

155
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no choice, huh...?</font>

156
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I have a condition.</font>

157
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring the two back alive. Got it?</font>

158
00:11:57,190 --> 00:12:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure, even if it costs my life.</font>

159
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too dangerous of a mission even
with that Jiraiya going with them...</font>

160
00:12:28,010 --> 00:12:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

161
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Land of Rice Paddies where
the Village Hidden in the Sound is.</font>

162
00:12:49,330 --> 00:12:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's that Orochimaru's headquarters.</font>

163
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take sufficient caution and proceed.</font>

164
00:12:57,460 --> 00:13:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's kind of anticlimactic...</font>

165
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:05,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I thought a bunch of
Orochimaru's followers would greet us!</font>

166
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this really the Hidden Sound Village?</font>

167
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems to be a peaceful
quiet and nice land but...</font>

168
00:13:12,890 --> 00:13:16,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, we still haven't entered
Village Hidden in the Sound.</font>

169
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:18,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Land of Rice Paddies.</font>

170
00:13:18,770 --> 00:13:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Land of Rice Paddies?</font>

171
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a small land that's nothing special.</font>

172
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:26,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The feudal lord was a foolish lord who
hungered for powerful military strength</font>

173
00:13:26,410 --> 00:13:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to make the land
disproportionately larger.</font>

174
00:13:31,450 --> 00:13:35,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then Orochimaru probably won favor
with some fast-talking...</font>

175
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course Orochimaru himself wasn't
thinking about making the land stronger.</font>

176
00:13:41,210 --> 00:13:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He just had an ambition to make himself
stronger and to carry out revenge...</font>

177
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:51,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why there's nothing in this area
that points to his presence.</font>

178
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? And so Pervy Sage...!</font>

179
00:13:54,060 --> 00:13:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't call me Pervy Sage!</font>

180
00:13:56,890 --> 00:14:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...
He's one of the legendary Sannin so...</font>

181
00:14:01,230 --> 00:14:05,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just a lady-loving
perverted Pervy Sage!</font>

182
00:14:05,740 --> 00:14:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

183
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:11,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly
where's the Village Hidden in the Sound?</font>

184
00:14:12,450 --> 00:14:14,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beats me... I don't know...</font>

185
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:15,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

186
00:14:15,950 --> 00:14:19,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know where it is
so we're going to investigate, right?</font>

187
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a point but...</font>

188
00:14:22,090 --> 00:14:24,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how do we find it?</font>

189
00:14:25,010 --> 00:14:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There can't be a place where
people are without food and ladies.</font>

190
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People gather where
there's food and girls!</font>

191
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:36,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Where people gather there's news.
— There goes Pervy Sage's bad habit.</font>

192
00:14:36,060 --> 00:14:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's planning to sow his wild oats
under the guise of a special mission.</font>

193
00:14:39,310 --> 00:14:42,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First off, finding a traveler's town with
lots of hot ladies is the top priority!</font>

194
00:14:42,770 --> 00:14:46,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Every land should have a traveler's town.</font>

195
00:14:48,490 --> 00:14:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Lodging"</b></font>

196
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a traveler's town... right?</font>

197
00:14:58,410 --> 00:15:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like nobody's living here anymore.</font>

198
00:15:02,210 --> 00:15:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I feel the presence of people...</font>

199
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:06,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the smell of face powder!</font>

200
00:15:10,590 --> 00:15:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto, take it out.
— Take what out?</font>

201
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't act as you don't know!</font>

202
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:17,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In anything one does
a war chest is necessary, right?</font>

203
00:15:17,770 --> 00:15:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What! Are you after my wallet? Man!</font>

204
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:28,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! This shouldn't be it!
Try jumping!</font>

205
00:15:28,990 --> 00:15:29,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

206
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Stop!</font>

207
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:41,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two, three... Is this all you got?</font>

208
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all of it really!</font>

209
00:15:45,290 --> 00:15:46,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Here...
— Huh?</font>

210
00:15:47,380 --> 00:15:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not much but please use it.</font>

211
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:52,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Sakura-chan there's no need for
you to give that to him!</font>

212
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's money for
gathering information, right?</font>

213
00:15:56,510 --> 00:15:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, right. This should be enough.</font>

214
00:16:03,190 --> 00:16:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys go on ahead to the outskirts
of the post station and wait!</font>

215
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:08,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Why?</font>

216
00:16:08,650 --> 00:16:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too dangerous ahead from here.
It's a mission for adults.</font>

217
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:42,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, the smell of
face powder's from here.</font>

218
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome...</font>

219
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Along came a sucker just begging
to be parted from his money.</font>

220
00:16:53,530 --> 00:16:56,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should be able to pulverize him.</font>

221
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:03,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Food and Drink! And young women!</font>

222
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you give the Pervy Sage money</font>

223
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:18,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's just going to sow his oats without
gathering any information anyway.</font>

224
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:19,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sow his oats...?</font>

225
00:17:20,100 --> 00:17:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah...
I don't really know about it but...</font>

226
00:17:23,350 --> 00:17:25,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know make-out blah-blah-blah...</font>

227
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's fine!
If I can be of at least some help...</font>

228
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm always a hindrance
who can't do anything so...</font>

229
00:17:32,650 --> 00:17:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like that!</font>

230
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place
if you hadn't taken the action...</font>

231
00:17:39,490 --> 00:17:42,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd still be tied to the bed!</font>

232
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:48,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Brothel"</b></font>

233
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even in different lands
there are young women everywhere.</font>

234
00:17:53,630 --> 00:17:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So? Why don't we move to
the room in the back?</font>

235
00:17:56,260 --> 00:17:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to talk more relaxed.</font>

236
00:17:59,340 --> 00:18:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice, nice.</font>

237
00:18:01,010 --> 00:18:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then first settle up the tab
for here, okay?</font>

238
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I already drunk
on this cheap drink...?</font>

239
00:18:08,190 --> 00:18:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't there like three too many zeros?</font>

240
00:18:12,230 --> 00:18:13,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You like to joke, do you?</font>

241
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you value your life
leave all you've got on you here.</font>

242
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see how it is.</font>

243
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master Jiraiya's late.</font>

244
00:18:42,890 --> 00:18:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sick of waiting.</font>

245
00:18:48,690 --> 00:18:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

246
00:18:57,190 --> 00:18:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's there?!</font>

247
00:19:11,670 --> 00:19:15,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?!
Are you one of Orochimaru's followers?!</font>

248
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:18,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Was I wrong?!</font>

249
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it.</font>

250
00:19:22,390 --> 00:19:25,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid had erased his presence
until he'd gotten that close.</font>

251
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let him get away!</font>

252
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move!</font>

253
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Why?!</font>

254
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:31,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Makibishi Spikes!</font>

255
00:19:35,070 --> 00:19:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

256
00:19:37,650 --> 00:19:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What?!</font>

257
00:19:52,830 --> 00:19:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hold it! You jerk!
— We won't let you get away!</font>

258
00:19:55,380 --> 00:19:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, what's that?!</font>

259
00:19:57,800 --> 00:20:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage? What did you do?!</font>

260
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell you later!
Anyway, let's get out of here!</font>

261
00:20:03,050 --> 00:20:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

262
00:20:04,390 --> 00:20:05,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Companions of the person just now?</font>

263
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they're Orochimaru's followers
with my Shadow Clone Jutsu I'll...</font>

264
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No no! Don't get the wrong idea!</font>

265
00:20:13,650 --> 00:20:16,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're just bodyguards from a rip-off bar!</font>

266
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Rip-off bar...?!</font>

267
00:20:20,190 --> 00:20:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First and foremost this mission has
to be carried out in strict secrecy!</font>

268
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There'd be no point if you were
to use Ninja Art and stand out!</font>

269
00:20:29,620 --> 00:20:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! Carry the bags!</font>

270
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one who's totally standing out
is you Pervy Sage!</font>

271
00:20:36,170 --> 00:20:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have a point.</font>

272
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is wrong!
Will we really reach Sasuke like this?!</font>

273
00:21:10,450 --> 00:21:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

274
00:21:10,450 --> 00:21:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

275
00:21:15,220 --> 00:21:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

276
00:21:15,220 --> 00:21:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

277
00:21:21,620 --> 00:21:26,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

278
00:21:21,620 --> 00:21:26,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

279
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

280
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

281
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

282
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

